WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.200
JevTO v0.1.1. A generated test fixture, run by the real CLI.

00:03.200 --> 00:05.500
The native test run: 150 passing tests and one deliberate failure.

00:05.500 --> 00:10.500
Rules-only selection keeps the failure and assertion. Exit code 101 is preserved.

00:10.500 --> 00:14.300
Recall reads the captured stdout without rerunning the tests. First four lines shown.

00:14.300 --> 00:17.720
Less tool output. Exact recall. Installation and evidence at jevto.xyz.
